  "body": "Tucked away in the heart of Torbay, this property offers the perfect blend of serene suburban living and unbeatable accessibility. This is more than a house; it's a lifestyle upgrade where every detail has been considered for modern family comfort.\r\n\r\nLocation is everything, and this property delivers in spades. Enjoy the ultimate coastal lifestyle just a 5-minute stroll to the golden sands of Waiake Beach—perfect for morning swims or sunset walks. Zoned for the highly regarded Torbay Schools and kindergarten, your children’s education is just a quick 5 min walk away, saving you precious time on school runs. \r\n\r\nCommuters will love the effortless access to the motorway, making travel a breeze, while the peaceful, friendly neighbourhood offers a safe and quiet retreat from the city buzz.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a thoughtfully designed floor plan that maximizes space and natural light. The low maintenance back yard provides room for children to play, pets to roam, and space for entertaining. With central air conditioning, you will stay comfortable all year round, no matter the season. \r\n\r\nParking is a non-issue with single garage, and for the eco-conscious or EV owners, there is pre-installed EV charging capability ready to go.\r\n\r\nBeyond your doorstep, you are perfectly positioned. A short distance to the vibrant Albany shopping and dining precinct, while prestigious North Shore private schools are equally close, ensuring top-tier education options are always within reach.\r\n\r\nHere is not just a home—it’s a smart investment in your family’s future. Don’t miss this rare opportunity to secure a property that truly has it all. Call us today to arrange viewing.",
